Note on bundled assets

The logo images under assets/ (scu-logo.png and scu-logo-white-transparent.png)
depict the emblem of Sichuan University. Their copyright belongs to Sichuan
University and they are included only for identification purposes. They are NOT
covered by the MIT License above. Replace or remove them if you redistribute
this template outside an SCU context, and follow the university's visual
identity guidelines for any official use.

This template is an individual work and is not an official Sichuan University
template.
